      "items": [{ "fontColor": { "solid": { "color": "#1F2328" } }, "background": { "solid": { "color": "#FFFFFF" } }, "outline": "Frame", "outlineColor": { "solid": { "color": "#D0D7DE" } }, "textSize": 12 }],
      "header": [{ "fontColor": { "solid": { "color": "#57606A" } }, "textSize": 11, "show": true }],
      "slicerHeader": [{ "fontColor": { "solid": { "color": "#57606A" } }, "textSize": 11 }],
      "selection": [{ "strictSingleSelect": true }],
      "dropdown": [{ "fontColor": { "solid": { "color": "#1F2328" } }, "background": { "solid": { "color": "#FFFFFF" } } }],
      "background": [{ "show": false }] } }
  }
}
